OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785197885
OL,3,CAbbey Road photography exhibition
OL,4,C'explores almost a century of music
OL,5,Chistory'
OL,7,FIt is now also the focus of the
OL,8,Fexhibition Abbey Road: Reframed, which
OL,9,Fpresents three interconnected
OL,10,Fperspectives: The Art Of Recording,
OL,11,FIconic Image Makers and the Abbey Road
OL,12,FMusic Photography Accelerator.
OL,14,FTogether, they explore the artistry in
OL,15,Fthe recording process, celebrate the
OL,16,Fphotographers whose work has shaped
OL,17,Fmusic culture, and champion the next
OL,18,Fgeneration of image-makers defining
OL,19,Fits future.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785197885
OL,3,CAbbey Road photography exhibition
OL,4,C'explores almost a century of music
OL,5,Chistory'
OL,7,FAbbey Road has said the exhibition is
OL,8,Fa "reflection on how music photography
OL,9,Fnot only captures moments of creation,
OL,10,Fbut shapes how music is seen, felt and
OL,11,Fremembered in our own lives".
OL,13,FIt will also offer a "rare
OL,14,Fopportunity" to see photographs of
OL,15,Fitems from the Abbey Road collection
OL,16,Fwhich have never been exhibited.
OL,26,@pD@COUsD@\O]uD@VOUvD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
