FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785197885
OL,3,CAbbey Road photography exhibition
OL,4,C'explores almost a century of music
OL,5,Chistory'
OL,7,FSome of the photographed items include
OL,8,Fthe Neumann U47 microphone, the
OL,9,Fstudio's Mrs Mills piano, and studio
OL,10,Fdocuments handwritten by Abbey Road
OL,11,Fengineers.
OL,13,FOther items captured include The
OL,14,FHitmaker, Nile Rodgers' 1960 Fender
OL,15,FStratocaster guitar in Olympic White,
OL,16,Fwhich he used on a string of hits
OL,17,Fincluding David Bowie's Let's Dance.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785197885
OL,3,CAbbey Road photography exhibition
OL,4,C'explores almost a century of music
OL,5,Chistory'
OL,7,FAnother is the Hammond RT-3 Organ
OL,8,Fwhich Richard Wright used throughout
OL,9,FPink Floyd's The Dark Side Of The Moon
OL,10,Falbum.
OL,12,FFor the first time, fans will also get
OL,13,Fa look at the inside of the Sgt Pepper
OL,14,Fmono master tape, alongside the famous
OL,15,FNeumann U48 microphone used on
OL,16,Fcountless vocals, the Studer J37 4-
OL,17,Ftrack machine that committed it all to
OL,18,Ftape, and the piece of pop-art history
OL,19,Fthat is the Sgt Pepper drum designed
OL,20,Fby Sir Peter Blake.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
